The issues and the fixes I've implemented:

1. The main problem was that the app was crashing when clicking on "Quản lý đơn hàng" (Manage Orders) button because the PermissionManager wasn't properly loading the user before checking permissions.

2. In AdminDashboardActivity:
 - Modified the button click handler to first load the current user information using the loadCurrentUser method with a proper callback.
 - Only navigates to AdminOrdersActivity after successfully loading the user.

3. In AdminOrdersActivity:
 - Reorganized the permission check to happen after loading all UI components.
 - Added proper user loading with callback before checking admin permissions.
 - Only proceeds to load orders after confirming the user has admin rights.
 - Added error handling to show appropriate messages and close the activity if user loading fails.

