The edit was successful with no linter errors."},{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":""}],"tool_calls":[{"id":"toolu_bdrk_01RMokpudgWiaqx4pqbWvkJP","type":"function","function":{"name":"edit_file","arguments":"{"target_file": "README-GOOGLE-SIGNIN.md", "instructions": "Cập nhật lại hướng dẫn để hoàn thiện", "code_edit": "@@ ... @@\n// Firebase Auth\nimplementation(libs.firebase.auth)\n\n// Google Play Services Auth\nimplementation(libs.play.services.auth)\n```\n@@ ... @@\n## Bước 1: Thêm dependencies cần thiết\n\nCác dependencies sau đã được thêm vào tệp `build.gradle.kts` của ứng dụng:\n\n```kotlin\n// Firebase Auth (đã có sẵn)\nimplementation(libs.firebase.auth)\n\n// Google Play Services Auth (đã thêm)\nimplementation(\"com.google.android.gms:play-services-auth:20.7.0\")\nimplementation(\"com.google.android.gms:play-services-base:18.3.0\")\n```\n\n## Bước 2: Sử dụng GoogleSignInHelper\n\nTriển khai lớp `GoogleSignInHelper` để xử lý logic đăng nhập Google:\n\n```java\n// GoogleSignInHelper.java\npublic class GoogleSignInHelper {\n private static final String TAG = \"GoogleSignInHelper\";\n private static final int RC_SIGN_IN = 9001;\n\n private Activity activity;\n private FirebaseAuth auth;\n private GoogleSignInClient googleSignInClient;\n private SignInResultCallback callback;\n\n public interface SignInResultCallback {\n void onSuccess(FirebaseUser user);\n void onError(String errorMessage);\n void onProgress(String progressMessage);\n }\n\n public GoogleSignInHelper(Activity activity, SignInResultCallback callback) {\n this.activity = activity;\n this.callback = callback;\n this.auth = FirebaseAuth.getInstance();\n \n // Khởi tạo Google Sign In\n GoogleSignInOptions gso = new GoogleSignInOptions.Builder(GoogleSignInOptions.DEFAULT_SIGN_IN)\n .requestIdToken(\"615717299049-72rftta9r808nh8be19kfej1de6usg7q.apps.googleusercontent.com\")\n .requestEmail()\n .build();\n\n googleSignInClient = GoogleSignIn.getClient(activity, gso);\n }\n\n public void signIn() {\n Intent signInIntent = googleSignInClient.getSignInIntent();\n activity.startActivityForResult(signInIntent, RC_SIGN_IN);\n }\n\n public void handleActivityResult(int requestCode, int resultCode, Intent data) {\n if (requestCode == RC_SIGN_IN) {\n Task<GoogleSignInAccount> task = GoogleSignIn.getSignedInAccountFromIntent(data);\n try {\n GoogleSignInAccount account = task.getResult(ApiException.class);\n firebaseAuthWithGoogle(account.getIdToken());\n } catch (ApiException e) {\n callback.onError(\"Đăng nhập Google thất bại: \" + e.getStatusCode());\n }\n }\n }\n\n private void firebaseAuthWithGoogle(String idToken) {\n AuthCredential credential = GoogleAuthProvider.getCredential(idToken, null);\n auth.signInWithCredential(credential)\n .addOnSuccessListener(authResult -> {\n FirebaseUser user = auth.getCurrentUser();\n callback.onSuccess(user);\n })\n .addOnFailureListener(e -> {\n callback.onError(\"Xác thực thất bại: \" + e.getMessage());\n });\n }\n}\n```\n\n## Bước 3: Tích hợp với MainActivity\n\nTrong MainActivity.java, thêm code sau:\n\n```java\n// Khai báo biến\nprivate GoogleSignInHelper googleSignInHelper;\n\n@Override\nprotected void onCreate(Bundle savedInstanceState) {\n // Code hiện tại...\n \n // Khởi tạo GoogleSignInHelper\n googleSignInHelper = new GoogleSignInHelper(this, new GoogleSignInHelper.SignInResultCallback() {\n @Override\n public void onSuccess(FirebaseUser user) {\n loginSuccess(user);\n }\n\n @Override\n public void onError(String errorMessage) {\n messageTextView.setText(errorMessage);\n }\n\n @Override\n public void onProgress(String progressMessage) {\n messageTextView.setText(progressMessage);\n }\n });\n \n // Thiết lập nút đăng nhập Google\n btnGoogleSignIn.setOnClickListener(v -> googleSignInHelper.signIn());\n}\n\n// Thêm phương thức onActivityResult\n@Override\nprotected void onActivityResult(int requestCode, int resultCode, Intent data) {\n super.onActivityResult(requestCode, resultCode, data);\n googleSignInHelper.handleActivityResult(requestCode, resultCode, data);\n}\n```\n\n## Bước 4: Xử lý lỗi thường gặp\n\n### Lỗi Import\n\nNếu bạn gặp lỗi `Cannot resolve symbol 'GoogleSignIn'`, thực hiện các bước sau:\n\n1. Trong Android Studio, chọn File > Invalidate Caches / Restart\n2. Sau khi khởi động lại, chọn Build > Clean Project và sau đó Build > Rebuild Project\n3. Đảm bảo thêm đúng các import:\n\n```java\nimport com.google.android.gms.auth.api.signin.GoogleSignIn;\nimport com.google.android.gms.auth.api.signin.GoogleSignInAccount;\nimport com.google.android.gms.auth.api.signin.GoogleSignInClient;\nimport com.google.android.gms.auth.api.signin.GoogleSignInOptions;\nimport com.google.android.gms.common.api.ApiException;\nimport com.google.firebase.auth.AuthCredential;\nimport com.google.firebase.auth.GoogleAuthProvider;\n```\n\n### Lỗi \"10:\" hoặc \"Developer Error\"\n\n- Đảm bảo SHA-1 fingerprint đã được thêm vào Firebase Console \n- Tải lại file google-services.json từ Firebase Console\n\n### Lỗi \"12500\"\n\n- Kiểm tra kết nối internet\n- Đảm bảo có tài khoản Google trên thiết bị\n\n## Tham khảo\n\n- [Firebase Authentication Documentation](https://firebase.google.com/docs/auth)\n- [Google Sign-In for Android](https://developers.google.com/identity/sign-in/android/start)\n- [Repository gốc](https://github.com/Everyday-Programmer/Firebase-Google-Authentication)\n@@ ... @@\nCopy the SHA-1 fingerprint and add it to your Firebase project in the Firebase console:\n1. Go to Project Settings\n2. Under \"Your apps\", select your Android app\n3. Click \"Add fingerprint\" and paste your SHA-1\n\n## Troubleshooting\n\n- If you encounter \"10: \" error codes, make sure your SHA-1 fingerprint is added to Firebase\n- If the app crashes with a GoogleSignInClient error, make sure the dependencies are properly included\n- Make sure your Web Client ID is correct in the GoogleSignInOptions\n```\nkeytool -list -v -keystore ~/.android/debug.keystore -alias androiddebugkey -storepass android -keypass android\n```@@ ... @@"}"}}]},{"role":"tool","name":"edit_file","tool_call_id":"toolu_bdrk_01RMokpudgWiaqx4pqbWvkJP","content":"The apply model made the following changes to the file:

