-
-Copy the SHA-1 fingerprint and add it to your Firebase project in the Firebase console:
-
-1. Go to Project Settings
-2. Under "Your apps", select your Android app
-3. Click "Add fingerprint" and paste your SHA-1
-
-## Troubleshooting
-
-- If you encounter "10: " error codes, make sure your SHA-1 fingerprint is added to Firebase
-- If the app crashes with a GoogleSignInClient error, make sure the dependencies are properly
- included
-- Make sure your Web Client ID is correct in the GoogleSignInOptions
-
