: \" + e.getMessage());\n });\n }\n \n /**\n * Create a new user in Firestore\n * @param user FirebaseUser object\n */\n private void createNewUserInFirestore(FirebaseUser user) {\n final FirebaseFirestore db = FirebaseFirestore.getInstance();\n \n // Create a new user object\n User newUser = new User(\n user.getUid(),\n user.getEmail(),\n user.getDisplayName() != null ? user.getDisplayName() : \"User\",\n \"\", \"\", \"\", \"user\"\n );\n \n // Save to Firestore\n db.collection(\"users\").document(user.getUid())\n .set(newUser)\n .addOnSuccessListener(aVoid -> {\n Log.d(TAG, \"User record created for: \" + user.getEmail());\n callback.onSuccess(newUser);\n })\n .addOnFailureListener(e -> {\n Log.e(TAG, \"Error creating user\", e);\n callback.onError(\"Error creating user profile: \" + e.getMessage());\n });\n }\n}"}"}}]},{"role":"tool","name":"edit_file","tool_call_id":"toolu_bdrk_01Cj3Q5TzxLPzWT1udmHR4Xg","content":"The apply model made the following changes to the file:

